%% COKES
#coke-bottles
(* is #in #tomb-of-the-unknown-implementer)
(name *)	bunch of Coke bottles
(item *)
(dict *)	bottl coke cokes bunch bottles
(* size is 15)
(appearance *)
	Many empty Coke bottles are here. Alas, they can't hold water.
(initial appearance *)
	There is a large pile of empty Coke bottles here, evidently produced by
	the implementers during their long struggle to win totally.
